00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Hello children, I am Mary with one more story always help.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,000
John was a selfish boy.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
He never helped and shared anything with anyone.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,000
His parents are worried about his selfish behavior.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,000
One day John was returning home on his new home bicycle.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,000
He saw a girl falling down on the road.

7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,000
The girl tried for help.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:41,000
John never helped anyone till now but he helped the girl that day.

9
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:47,000
He said, you got hurt and you should go to hospital and took her to the hospital.

10
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Wow!

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Later one day the girl parents came to the boy house and thanked the boy.

12
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Seeing all that the boy parents felt very happy.

13
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Moral helping need is a helping deed.

